      "@type": "Service",
      "name": "Ribbon Fiber Optic Cable",
      "serviceType": "Fiber optic cable supply (build-to-order)",
      "description": "Rollable and flat ribbon fiber optic cable, 12F to 3456F, on Fujikura preform glass, build-to-order with 6 to 8 week lead times (up to 10 weeks for custom builds) for hyperscale routes.",
      "image": "https://www.vocom.ai/assets/img/rollable-ribbon-fiber-optic-cable-beb7db.png",
      "url": "https://www.vocom.ai/ribbon-fiber-optic-cable",
      "category": "Fiber Optic Cable",
      "provider": {
        "@id": "https://www.vocom.ai/#organization"
      },
      "areaServed": "Worldwide"
    },
    {
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the difference between rollable and flat ribbon?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Flat ribbon holds twelve fibers rigid in a plane. Rollable ribbon lets the array flex along its length, so it packs into a smaller cable diameter. At 20mm OD, flat ribbon carries 432F and rollable carries 864F. Both splice on the same mass fusion machine."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is the highest count you supply?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "6912F. The 6912F ribbon spec is available at 38.0mm OD and 1064 kg per km (LSZH), built as 432 ribbons of sixteen fibers on G.657A1 or G.657A2. The 1728F dielectric spec remains available too, at 28.4mm OD and 482 kg per km, built as 144 ribbons of twelve fibers on G.652D."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is ribbon cable compatible with our existing flat ribbon splices?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Rollable ribbon is designed to splice against flat ribbon without error, and twelve-fiber compatibility is confirmed."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What are typical lead times?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "6 to 8 weeks from PO, up to 10 weeks for custom builds. Domestic ribbon at high count is frequently quoted in months, sometimes longer where a manufacturer has pre-existing contract commitments."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is rollable ribbon fiber cable?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Rollable ribbon fiber cable is ribbon that flexes along its length instead of staying flat, which lets the same duct carry close to double the fiber count of flat ribbon. Vocom sources rollable ribbon cable from 12F up to 6912F on G.657A1 or G.657A2, build to order on Fujikura preform glass, with standard delivery in 6 to 8 weeks."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}

